<main>
<section class="intro">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR APEX TRADING SYSTEM</p><h1 id="pageHeading">Operations overview</h1><p class="subhead" id="pageSubhead">Broker prices, automatic AI decisions and real infrastructure status.</p></div>
  <div class="mode-stack"><div class="mode on">● AUTOMATIC ANALYSIS <b id="analysisStatus">CHECKING</b></div><div class="mode off" id="demoMode">● AUTOMATIC DEMO <b id="demoModeValue">CHECKING</b></div></div>
</section>

<div class="notice" id="safetyNotice"><span class="notice-icon">◈</span><div><b>Deriv DEMO environment</b><span id="safetyNoticeText">Checking controlled DEMO execution and broker reconciliation. LIVE trading is disabled.</span></div></div>

<section id="overview" class="view active">
  <div class="kpis">
    <article class="metric"><span>Verified instruments</span><strong id="kpiSymbols">—</strong><small>Deriv synthetic indices</small></article>
